# Open AI Playground


# Create environment
```
module load miniconda
mamba create -y -n ai python=3.12
conda activate ai
pip3 install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu126
mamba install -y -c conda-forge pandas notebook
pip install python-slugify  # this library is needed for openai installation
pip install openai
```

# Run environment
```
module load miniconda
conda activate ai
```